{"seq":47,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f28317"},"reason":"New fact: Laylat al-Qadr, the holiest night of Ramadan – a natural addition to the article's fasting pillar.","by":"fact-count-rework","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Night_of_Power"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Al-Qadr_(surah)"}],"changes":[{"field":"answerEn","new":"Laylat al-Qadr"},{"field":"answerDe","new":"Lailat al-Qadr"},{"field":"answerRu","new":"Ночь аль-Кадр"},{"field":"spans","new":{"en":[2094,14],"de":[2249,14],"ru":[2102,13]}},{"field":"timeline","new":{"kind":"event","start":"610","end":null,"precision":"year","approx":true,"ongoing":false,"labelEn":"The first revelation of the Quran to Muhammad, remembered on Laylat al-Qadr","labelDe":"Die erste Offenbarung des Korans an Mohammed, an die die Lailat al-Qadr erinnert","labelRu":"Первое откровение Корана Мухаммеду, о котором напоминает Ночь аль-Кадр"}},{"field":"source","new":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Night_of_Power","title":"Night of Power – Wikipedia","lang":"en"}}],"hash":"77bc731a10ce"},
{"seq":48,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w27317"},"reason":"New generated wording for the new fact f28317.","by":"fact-count-rework","changes":[{"field":"en","new":"What is the night in the last ten days of Ramadan called on which Muslims remember the first revelation of the Quran, a night \"better than a thousand months\"?"},{"field":"de","new":"Wie heißt die Nacht in den letzten zehn Tagen des Ramadan, in der Muslime der ersten Offenbarung des Korans gedenken – eine Nacht, „besser als tausend Monate“?"},{"field":"ru","new":"Как называется ночь в последней декаде рамадана, когда мусульмане вспоминают первое ниспослание Корана, — ночь, которая «лучше тысячи месяцев»?"},{"field":"origin","new":"generated"},{"field":"fact","new":"f28317"}],"hash":"8cc2512b32c9"},
